# Mutually exclusive limited feature preview. See docs/BILIBILI_DIAGNOSIS.md.
name: 哔哩哔哩去广告 · app 域名精简兼容预览
desc: 基于 05 卡、06 正常的真机对照，只解密 app.bilibili.com，恢复开屏/首页/竖屏推荐的原生过滤。不含 JS、评论/弹幕处理、请求转发、空降和域名拦截；grpc 广告不处理。与主模块、诊断版及其他 B站覆写互斥，手机效果待验收。
version: 2026.10.25-app-preview.1
category: 去广告
homepage: https://github.com/xian2023/stash-modules
author: kokoryh (original scripts); Kelee (original rules); local Stash adaptation
icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/luestr/IconResource/main/App_icon/120px/Bilibili.png
http:
  mitm:
    - app.bilibili.com
  body-rewrite:
    - (?i)^https:\/\/app\.bilibili\.com\/x\/v2\/splash\/(show|event\/list2)\? response-jq .data |= with_entries(if .key | IN("show", "event_list") then .value = [] else . end)
    - (?i)^https:\/\/app\.bilibili\.com\/x\/v2\/feed\/index\? response-jq if .data.items then .data.items |= map(select((.banner_item == null) and (.ad_info == null) and (.card_goto == "av") and (.card_type | IN("small_cover_v2", "large_cover_single_v9", "large_cover_v1")))) end
    - (?i)^https:\/\/app\.bilibili\.com\/x\/v2\/feed\/index\/story\? response-jq if .data.items then .data.items |= map(select((.ad_info == null) and (.card_goto | IN("vertical_ad_av", "vertical_ad_live", "vertical_ad_picture") | not)) | del(.story_cart_icon, .free_flow_toast, .image_infos, .course_info, .game_info)) end
  mock:
    - match: (?i)^https:\/\/app\.bilibili\.com\/x\/v2\/splash\/list\?
      status-code: 200
      text: '{"code":0,"message":"OK","ttl":1,"data":{"max_time":0,"min_interval":31536000,"pull_interval":31536000,"keep_ids":[],"show":[],"list":[{}],"splash_request_id":""}}'
      headers:
        Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
